        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=348 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, you're the new manager? Pleased to meet you! <i>Chirp!~</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's work together on making our very own cafe, where all of our bird friends can come relax, enjoy tasty snacks and have a great time! <i>Can you help me figure out every bird's favorite snacks?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/f33981346724398667f906f4bfd2f85c.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn recipes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your menu selection over time by re-investing your earnings into more profitable snacks and drinks. From matcha lattes to strawberry shortcakes, help Chef Cafe become the best at their craft!<br><br><strong>Stock up on food:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a steady supply of food at the ready, so that your bird friends can keep ordering to their heart's content!<br><br><strong>Invite your bird friends:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything is ready, send your invitations and watch your hard work pay off as your friends enjoy the wonderful snacks and drinks you've prepared for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=520 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3b4c2050cf020d5ae35c1d1357a71d42.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Cafe features a gacha system with <strong>NO micro-transactions</strong> whatsoever, so you can enjoy fun surprises completely stress-free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the meals you serve both grant you <strong>coins</strong> (which you can use to progress through the game) and<strong> gems</strong> (which you can use for the gacha). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a varied and colorful cast of adorable birds and dress them up with cute accessories and outfits, all through this <strong>cozy take on gacha mechanics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=250 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gameplay:</strong> stock up on food and send out your invitations, then watch as your birds place their orders and eat at their own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Bird Friends:</strong> collect a variety of charming birds, and dress them up with adorable outfits and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha with NO micro-transactions:</strong> experience the thrill of gacha without spending any additional money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> use your earnings to expand your cafe, grow your menu and meet new birds to invite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> unlock a large variety of items to decorate your cafe to your own tastes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle minigame:</strong> solve unlimited fun puzzles as much as you like, to gain rewards that accelerate the idle experience</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=348 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/9e958d03887c1061b6e859070510413c.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, you're the new manager? Pleased to meet you! <i>Chirp!~</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's work together on making our very own cafe, where all of our bird friends can come relax, enjoy tasty snacks and have a great time! <i>Can you help me figure out every bird's favorite snacks?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/f33981346724398667f906f4bfd2f85c.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn recipes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your menu selection over time by re-investing your earnings into more profitable snacks and drinks. From matcha lattes to strawberry shortcakes, help Chef Cafe become the best at their craft!<br><br><strong>Stock up on food:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep a steady supply of food at the ready, so that your bird friends can keep ordering to their heart's content!<br><br><strong>Invite your bird friends:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everything is ready, send your invitations and watch your hard work pay off as your friends enjoy the wonderful snacks and drinks you've prepared for them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=520 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3a75f75a496be89c686c8094591e1923.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/3b4c2050cf020d5ae35c1d1357a71d42.avif?t=1762778019\" width=1024 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cafe Cafe features a gacha system with <strong>NO micro-transactions</strong> whatsoever, so you can enjoy fun surprises completely stress-free!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the meals you serve both grant you <strong>coins</strong> (which you can use to progress through the game) and<strong> gems</strong> (which you can use for the gacha). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend a varied and colorful cast of adorable birds and dress them up with cute accessories and outfits, all through this <strong>cozy take on gacha mechanics</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.poster.avif?t=1762778019\" width=250 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.webm?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3979710/extras/61688936a0e7e9b964493aec23e144c0.mp4?t=1762778019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Gameplay:</strong> stock up on food and send out your invitations, then watch as your birds place their orders and eat at their own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adorable Bird Friends:</strong> collect a variety of charming birds, and dress them up with adorable outfits and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gacha with NO micro-transactions:</strong> experience the thrill of gacha without spending any additional money!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progression:</strong> use your earnings to expand your cafe, grow your menu and meet new birds to invite</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customization:</strong> unlock a large variety of items to decorate your cafe to your own tastes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle minigame:</strong> solve unlimited fun puzzles as much as you like, to gain rewards that accelerate the idle experience</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A charming and cozy idle game that sits anywhere on your screen, where you'll befriend your very own flock of adorable birds. Serve delicious snacks, discover each bird's unique preferences, and watch your cafe flourish!",
